;; recorded in textSigs (builtins_textsig_table.go, tools/pyi/textsig_table.py). inspect.signature reads them (a class
;; whose __init__ and __new__ are object's has object's "()"), as do pydoc and rlcompleter. A heap type's comes from its
;; __doc__ as typeobject.c's _PyType_GetTextSignatureFromInternalDoc finds it.


